<%#
  "I asked and did not hear back."

  Deliberately a different mail from jp_x_failed, because the required action is
  different and the wrong action is costly. A failure means "it did not go out".
  THIS means "it may or may not have gone out", and the only way to find out is
  to look at the timeline. XPublishJob will not touch the thread again until a
  human answers — re-sending a tweet that already exists is how a thread gets
  posted twice, and a duplicate cannot be un-posted.

  Korean chrome (S9); the tweet text stays Japanese because it is the string the
  reader has to FIND on the timeline. Translating it would be actively harmful
  here — they would be searching for words that are not there.
%>
<div style="font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Apple SD Gothic Neo','Hiragino Sans','Noto Sans KR',sans-serif;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px;color:#1A1918;line-height:1.7">

  <div style="border:1px solid #F59E0B;background:#FEF3C7;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px">
    <strong style="color:#92400E">⚠️ <%= t("jp_admin.mail.unknown_title", seq: @seq) %></strong>
    <p style="font-size:13px;color:#92400E;margin:8px 0 0">
      <%= t("jp_admin.mail.unknown_body_html") %>
    </p>
  </div>

  <h1 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 6px">
    <%= t("jp_admin.episode", n: format("%02d", @post.content_ep)) %> <%= @post.title_ja %>
  </h1>
  <p style="font-size:13px;color:#6B6963;margin:0 0 20px"><code>/ja/blog/<%= @post.slug %></code></p>

  <h2 style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px">👀 <%= t("jp_admin.mail.unknown_todo") %></h2>
  <ol style="font-size:13.5px;padding-left:20px;margin:0 0 20px">
    <li style="margin-bottom:6px">
      <%= t("jp_admin.mail.unknown_step1_html", timeline: "https://x.com/safefile_jp", seq: @seq) %>
    </li>
    <li style="margin-bottom:6px">
      <%= t("jp_admin.mail.unknown_step2_html", next: @seq + 1) %>
    </li>
    <li style="margin-bottom:6px">
      <%= t("jp_admin.mail.unknown_step3_html", seq: @seq) %>
    </li>
  </ol>

  <h2 style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px">📋 <%= t("jp_admin.mail.thread_state") %></h2>
  <table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12.5px;width:100%;margin-bottom:18px">
    <tr style="background:#F8F7F4">
      <th style="padding:6px 8px;border:1px solid #E5E3DC;text-align:left"><%= t("jp_admin.show.kpi_id") %></th>
      <th style="padding:6px 8px;border:1px solid #E5E3DC;text-align:left"><%= t("jp_admin.show.x_state") %></th>
      <th style="padding:6px 8px;border:1px solid #E5E3DC;text-align:left">tweet_id</th>
    </tr>
    <% @tweets.each do |row| %>
      <tr<%= row["seq"] == @seq ? ' style="background:#FEF3C7"'.html_safe : "" %>>
        <td style="padding:6px 8px;border:1px solid #E5E3DC"><%= row["seq"] %></td>
        <td style="padding:6px 8px;border:1px solid #E5E3DC"><%= row["state"] %></td>
        <td style="padding:6px 8px;border:1px solid #E5E3DC"><code><%= row["tweet_id"] || t("jp_admin.none") %></code></td>
      </tr>
    <% end %>
  </table>

  <h2 style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px"><%= t("jp_admin.mail.full_text", seq: @seq) %></h2>
  <pre style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:inherit;font-size:13.5px;background:#F8F7F4;border:1px solid #E5E3DC;border-radius:10px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 18px"><%= @tweets.find { |row| row["seq"] == @seq }&.dig("text") %></pre>

  <p style="margin:0">
    <a href="<%= @preview_url %>"
       style="display:inline-block;background:#0A6E8A;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;padding:11px 20px;border-radius:12px">
      <%= t("jp_admin.mail.decide_in_admin") %>
    </a>
  </p>
</div>
